                                                "sense_id": "a655c2bf-95c0-3aec-8749-055e91b19221",
                                                "text": "2004, Anthropy, Re: To all BNP fans ... Group: alt.politics.british\nI am a member of the bnp and I have no colour hatred or muslimaphobia ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "569b1a02-3623-4d89-a2ca-18f0b33bcda6",
                                                "sense_id": "a655c2bf-95c0-3aec-8749-055e91b19221",
                                                "text": "2004 Dave, Think tank wants more UK racist laws Group: uk.politics.misc\nJust heard on the news that a \"think tank\" is advocating equating \"Muslimaphobia\" with racial descrimination. A muslim woman appeared on the box and cited an example where, at interview a muslim person in Western dress was asked how they would react to having an affair with a ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98114b2f-690b-4fd8-926f-7f3accaea387",
                                                "sense_id": "a655c2bf-95c0-3aec-8749-055e91b19221",
                                                "text": "2006, mugz, Re: Islamophobia or anti-Muslimism Group: soc.religion.islam\nYet, as a Christian, I am taught to hate the sin, but to love the sinner. So, in short, I hate Islam but I don't fear it, and I dont hate Muslims but I do fear them, so: Muslimaphobia and Anti-Isalm work better for me"
                                            }
