                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bab0ec77-8375-3256-abea-2060e2bcd1a9",
                                        "entry_id": "ab077ce9-2d1f-3b86-8bf4-71ea8d9d78d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice or attitude of opposing Islam or Muslims."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "045d9194-2635-4507-8154-d2460a731265",
                                                "sense_id": "bab0ec77-8375-3256-abea-2060e2bcd1a9",
                                                "text": "As we briefly examine below something of the internal dynamics of anti-Muslimism as an ideology, and a psychologically underpinned expressive vehicle for identity maintenance, the contextual factors that provide the grist for this defensive elated mill must be continuously borne in mind."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf9ba0b6-ed35-47df-ab57-fd1f0d6edb01",
                                                "sense_id": "bab0ec77-8375-3256-abea-2060e2bcd1a9",
                                                "text": "The rise of a new anti-Muslimism in Serbia draws, in the first instance, on the experience of World War II […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73e810aa-4966-43c7-89c2-a564d6fed8f6",
                                                "sense_id": "bab0ec77-8375-3256-abea-2060e2bcd1a9",
                                                "text": "Burma (Myanmar) has been in the headlines of international media for the eruption of anti-Muslim riots in the country in 2012. Using historical background, this paper makes an attempt to explain the causes of anti-Muslimism in Myanmar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
